      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUBY RHAYNE BOW (2) finished second last start in the Group Three QBred Classic Final won by Stripes over 1660m at this track. Spell off the back of that but looked the part winning a trial in preparation for this. Drawn well so a first-up win is on the cards. AMYLEE (7) turned in a much better run last time out when runner-up over 2138m at this track, beaten a head. Facing a tougher assignment but she is capable of running another big race. QUEEN TIDE (10) finished third last start in that Group Three feature won by Stripes. Top-shelf three-year-old filly who is nicely placed to return in style. SERENUS (4) is worth some thought after her last-start fifth over 1780m at Redcliffe on August 7.",
